  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Festa 2014 was held in five cities: at Act City Hamamatsu on 26 October 2014, Sunshine City in Tokyo on 1 and 2 November, Kumamoto on 9 November, Intex Osaka on 16 November and Yume Messe Miyagi on 24 November. Every visitor got an original holo Pikachu and Gengar Spirit Link. Play Points from the side battles (3 on 3, tag and one-day battles) and mini-games bought prizes such as an original Sylveon for seven points or the pair Absol-EX and M Absol-EX for twelve. Its tournament was the Victory Battle Gym MIX.",
